  "title": "OpenSecureAI Alliance: Tech Partners Join to Enhance AI Security",
  "summary": "Microsoft, SpaceX, IBM, and others have launched the Open Secure AI Alliance to address AI security risks, directly responding to OpenAI's recent cyberattack on Hugging Face. The initiative aims to develop and share open-source AI security tools to defend against attacks from frontier models. Meanwhile, Microsoft has introduced its first AI security model and a new agentic cybersecurity system to bolster its cybersecurity offerings.",
  "facts": [
